{
  "$comment": "How `pnpm engine roster` picks each slot from OpenRouter's /api/v1/models (SPEC \u00a73.2). Patterns are regular expressions over model IDs; the newest matching model wins, and a dated variant of it is preferred. Aliases (~...-latest), :batch and preview builds are excluded because they can change the serving model without notice. Paid tiers (budget, flagship) field the five labs openai, anthropic, google, meta and deepseek; their patterns end in `$`, so they never match a `:free` ID. The free tier tries every slot below in order and takes each lab's newest `:free` model; a lab with no free model today sits out (at least 3 and at most 6 models). Free labs and patterns checked against OpenRouter's list on 2026-10-25. Thinking Machines (Inkling) was dropped the same day: OpenRouter serves its free model only to coding agents (HTTP 403 for other apps).",
